          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 80,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "把舰核放入界面中央的核心槽位。槽位为空时不能进行改装。",
            "en_us": "Place the ship core in the central slot. Modification is disabled while the slot is empty."
