          "count": 1,
          "item": "piranport:destroyer_ship_core",
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 80,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "点击应用后部件绑定到舰核。取出舰核即可带走装备效果。销毁方块时内部物品全部掉落。",
            "en_us": "Click apply to bind the equipment. Retrieve the core to take the loadout with you. Breaking the block drops all stored items."
